# Data

- Memory is SQLite/JSON under `data/`. Do not add Postgres without an ADR.
- Knowledge source of truth is `knowledge/**/*.md`.
- Do not commit Chroma caches.
- Update `docs/DATA_MODEL.md` in the same PR as schema changes.
